,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动计划训练超5万亿参数大模型，规模或将位居国内首位</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI与Adobe达成深度合作，ChatGPT正式接入70多款Adobe创意工具</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 首款 AI 硬件细节曝光：甜甜圈造型、冰球大小，预计 2027 年发布</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里通义千问升级Qwen3.8-MAX并上线办公助理等核心功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b6dece8615fc06bfcee60eb8999fdae0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里通义千问大模型正式上线“思考研究”、“定时任务”及“办公助理”功能，并全面支持旗舰模型Qwen3.8-MAX。此次升级标志着大模型从辅助对话向自主执行转型。其中，“思考研究”模式强化了复杂推理与结构化报告生成能力；“办公助理”具备连接外部应用与操作系统的能力，可打通备忘录、日历及邮件，支持自主操作浏览器与电脑，直接交付Office文档，并实现手机与PC端的跨端协同。此外，“定时任务”功能支持自动化处理行业简报与邮件分类等周期性工作。通过整合语音通话能力与智能体广场，千问旨在构建覆盖专业办公到生活服务的全场景AI生态，旨在解决职场复杂决策与重复性工作痛点，推动AI在企业办公场景的深度落地。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布离线翻译硬件 Gemma Translator，基于树莓派运行 51 亿参数模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c98465b9990f07b5c8d75ae0e9f5b496.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌 Creative Lab 团队于 8 月 6 日推出离线翻译设备 Gemma Translator，该设备基于 Raspberry Pi 5 单板计算机开发，全程无需联网即可实现跨语种语音翻译。核心模型采用谷歌 Gemma 4E2B，总参数量 51 亿，激活参数量 23 亿，专为资源受限的边缘设备设计。系统通过 LiteRT-LM 框架执行翻译推理，并集成 Moonshine 模型进行本地语音转写与合成。用户通过麦克风输入语音后，设备可实时在显示器输出译文并经扬声器播报。此举展示了端侧模型从实验室走向独立成品的路径，证明了在边缘硬件上实现高性能离线翻译的可行性，为开发者提供了无需依赖云端算力的本地化 AI 应用参考范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动计划训练超5万亿参数大模型，规模或将位居国内首位</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d920e5095af766f1e5bde33cf9dac4e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动正处于讨论阶段，计划训练一个参数量超过5万亿的大模型，若最终落地，将成为国内已知规模最大的模型。该模型被视为对标GPT-5.6或Opus 5级别的性能水准，旨在显著提升豆包大模型的逻辑与推理能力。在算力需求方面，以H100显卡为基准，训练5万亿参数模型需百万张显卡运行约35天，或10万张显卡运行347天。考虑到算力投入与工程周期，字节跳动预计将采取20至30万张显卡进行3至4个月的训练，整体研发周期至少需半年至一年。目前该计划仍处于早期阶段，最终是否发布尚存变数。此举标志着国产大模型参数量正从万亿级别向更高量级跨越，但行业仍面临超高算力成本与商业化回报平衡的挑战。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与Adobe达成深度合作，ChatGPT正式接入70多款Adobe创意工具</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b947ac5e91223bb3eb606c2aa8ca4bc1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Adobe与OpenAI合作大幅扩容，自8月6日起，用户可在ChatGPT中直接调用Photoshop、Premiere、Acrobat、Lightroom、Illustrator及InDesign等70多款Adobe工具。用户只需在ChatGPT插件页面添加Adobe插件，通过输入“@Adobe”及具体指令，即可完成照片编辑、视频制作及PDF生成等任务。该插件支持与OpenAI的Codex及Work套件协同，登录Creative Cloud账户后可同步云端文件并调用Adobe Firefly生成式AI模型。Adobe副总裁Forrest Key表示，此举旨在将专业级创意工具嵌入用户工作流，但强调ChatGPT插件并非旗舰应用的替代品。此次集成标志着ChatGPT向“超级工作台”演进，通过消除软件切换成本，显著</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 首款 AI 硬件细节曝光：甜甜圈造型、冰球大小，预计 2027 年发布</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/52d3f21132ebb785afc1bf5c7019f1ff.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 首款自研 AI 硬件产品细节曝光，该设备由 OpenAI 与前苹果设计师 Jony Ive 合作开发，预计于 2027 年正式发布。产品外形呈“甜甜圈”造型，体积约为冰球大小（直径约 7.62 厘米），售价预估在 300 至 400 美元之间。该设备定位为无显示屏的家庭智能音箱，支持单手携带，配备可移动部件、灯光、摄像头及多种传感器，通过自动移动部件提示交互状态。在交互层面，该设备运行机制类似于手机端 ChatGPT 的语音模式，但将搭载更先进的 LLM 以实现更自然的类人交流。这是 OpenAI 首次尝试自研硬件，旨在通过与 Jony Ive 的深度合作，在工业设计与用户体验上建立差异化壁垒，将对话 AI 能力从软件层面延伸至家庭场景的硬件载体。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
